initial loading screen:
Tiny video in the top of the Duo going over to sit down at the piano (actualy dont make it a video, use the 3d models)
Circular Loading in the middle
Both are white, background is an image of dark blue sky, with stars?

When initial loading screen is done:
Circular Loading is removed
Keyboard with Black Cover appears in the bottom of the screen
"Enter" button in the middle of the Covered Keyboard

When you press the Enter button:
Cover cloth is removed
Keyboard keys start to be pressed
Each key playing a note and releasing a letter of the title: "DuoPiano" or "Welcome to DuoPiano"
which go upwards to the left of the logo
The letters are 3d models

After that:
Buttons:
	Single Player
	Two Player
	Setting
	About

